      "source": "<dt>Specified by:</dt>\n<dd><code><a href=\"PropertyValueConversions.html#getValueConverter(P)\">getValueConverter</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"PropertyValueConversions.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\">PropertyValueConversions</a></code></dd>\n<dt>Type Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><span id=\"getValueConverter(P)-type-param-DV\"><code>DV</code> - domain-specific type</span></dd>\n<dd><span id=\"getValueConverter(P)-type-param-SV\"><code>SV</code> - store-native type</span></dd>\n<dd><span id=\"getValueConverter(P)-type-param-P\"><code>P</code> - conversion context type</span></dd>\n<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>property</code> - <a href=\"../mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> used to look up the registered <a href=\"PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConverter</code></a>;\nmust not be null.</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>the <a href=\"PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConverter</code></a> registered for the given <a href=\"../mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a>;\nnever null.</dd>\n<dt>See Also:</dt>\n<dd>\n<ul class=\"tag-list-long\">\n<li><a href=\"PropertyValueConversions.html#hasValueConverter(org.springframework.data.mapping.PersistentProperty)\"><code>PropertyValueConversions.hasValueConverter(PersistentProperty)</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConverter</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>指定于：</dt>\n<dd><code><a href=\"PropertyValueConversions.html#getValueConverter(P)\">getValueConverter</a></code> 接口 <code><a href=\"PropertyValueConversions.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.convert 中的接口\">PropertyValueConversions</a></code> 中</dd>\n<dt>类型参数：</dt>\n<dd><span id=\"getValueConverter(P)-type-param-DV\"><code>DV</code> - 特定于领域的类型</span></dd>\n<dd><span id=\"getValueConverter(P)-type-param-SV\"><code>SV</code> - 存储原生类型</span></dd>\n<dd><span id=\"getValueConverter(P)-type-param-P\"><code>P</code> - 转换上下文类型</span></dd>\n<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>property</code> - 用于查找已注册的 <a href=\"PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.convert 中的接口\"><code>PropertyValueConverter</code></a> 的 <a href=\"../mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a>；\n不能为 null。</dd>\n<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>为给定 <a href=\"../mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> 注册的 <a href=\"PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.convert 中的接口\"><code>PropertyValueConverter</code></a>；\n永远不会为 null。</dd>\n<dt>另请参见：</dt>\n<dd>\n<ul class=\"tag-list-long\">\n<li><a href=\"PropertyValueConversions.html#hasValueConverter(org.springframework.data.mapping.PersistentProperty)\"><code>PropertyValueConversions.hasValueConverter(PersistentProperty)</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.convert 中的接口\"><code>PropertyValueConverter</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
