      "source": "<dt>Specified by:</dt>\n<dd><code><a href=\"PropertyValueConversions.html#hasValueConverter(org.springframework.data.mapping.PersistentProperty)\">hasValueConverter</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"PropertyValueConversions.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\">PropertyValueConversions</a></code></dd>\n<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>property</code> - <a href=\"../mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> to evaluate.</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>true if a <a href=\"PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConverter</code></a> has been registered for the given\n        <a href=\"../mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>property</code></a>.</dd>\n<dt>See Also:</dt>\n<dd>\n<ul class=\"tag-list\">\n<li><a href=\"../mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>指定于：</dt>\n<dd><code><a href=\"PropertyValueConversions.html#hasValueConverter(org.springframework.data.mapping.PersistentProperty)\">hasValueConverter</a></code> 接口 <code><a href=\"PropertyValueConversions.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.convert 中的接口\">PropertyValueConversions</a></code> 中</dd>\n<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>property</code> - 要评估的 <a href=\"../mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a>。</dd>\n<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>如果已为给定的 <a href=\"../mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>property</code></a> 注册了 <a href=\"PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.convert 中的接口\"><code>PropertyValueConverter</code></a>，则返回 true。</dd>\n<dt>另请参见：</dt>\n<dd>\n<ul class=\"tag-list\">\n<li><a href=\"../mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>",
